*-----------------------------------------------------------------------
ADD PROCESS FLEMILE-PREMAP VERSION 1
    MODULE SOURCE FOLLOWS
    MOVE SPACES TO WK-MSG.
    MOVE CURRENT DATE TO WK-TODAY.
    MOVE WK-TODAY(1:6) TO BP-PERIOD.
    OBTAIN CALC BENEFIT-PERIOD.
    IF DB-REC-NOT-FOUND OR BP-STAT NE 'O'
        DO.
        MOVE 'NO OPEN CLAIM PERIOD' TO WK-MSG.
        DISPLAY.
        END.
    IF WK-EMPID NE SPACES
        DO.
        MOVE WK-EMPID TO EM-EMPID.
        OBTAIN CALC EMPLOYEE.
        WHILE EM-STAT EQ 'T'
            REPEAT.
            OBTAIN DUPLICATE EMPLOYEE.
            END.
        END.
    DISPLAY.
    MSEND.
*-----------------------------------------------------------------------
ADD PROCESS FLEMILE-ENTER VERSION 1
    MODULE SOURCE FOLLOWS
    MOVE WK-EMPID TO EM-EMPID.
    OBTAIN CALC EMPLOYEE.
    IF DB-REC-NOT-FOUND
        DO.
        MOVE 'EMPLOYEE NOT ON FILE' TO WK-MSG.
        DISPLAY.
        END.
    WHILE EM-STAT EQ 'T'
        REPEAT.
        OBTAIN DUPLICATE EMPLOYEE.
        END.
    IF MC-DATE LT BP-STRT OR MC-DATE GT BP-END
        DO.
        MOVE 'JOURNEY DATE OUTSIDE OPEN PERIOD' TO WK-MSG.
        DISPLAY.
        END.
    IF MC-MILES EQ 0
        DO.
        MOVE 'MILES REQUIRED' TO WK-MSG.
        DISPLAY.
        END.
    COMPUTE WK-AMOUNT ROUNDED = MC-MILES * BP-MRATE.
    MOVE SPACES TO MC-VEHID.
    OBTAIN FIRST ASSIGNMENT WITHIN EMP-ASSIGN.
    IF DB-STATUS-OK
        DO.
        OBTAIN OWNER WITHIN VEH-ASSIGN.
        MOVE VH-VEHID TO MC-VEHID.
        END.
    ADD 1 TO WK-NEXT-CLM.
    MOVE 'C' TO MC-CLMID(1:1).
    MOVE WK-NEXT-CLM TO MC-CLMID(2:9).
    MOVE 'P' TO MC-STAT.
    FIND CURRENT EMPLOYEE.
    FIND CALC BENEFIT-PERIOD.
    STORE MILEAGE-CLAIM.
    COMMIT.
    MOVE 'CLAIM SUBMITTED FOR APPROVAL' TO WK-MSG.
    DISPLAY.
    MSEND.
*-----------------------------------------------------------------------
ADD PROCESS FLEMILE-PF3 VERSION 1
    MODULE SOURCE FOLLOWS
    MOVE SPACES TO WK-EMPID.
    TRANSFER CONTROL TO 'FLEMENU' NOFINISH.
    MSEND.
